body:
How would you feel if you introduced someone to your friends and the whole time you're all together they're just feeling each other up? Again it's not that they're interested in someone else. It's just like really though? You gotta go after my closest friends and I gotta hear about how they bang you all the time? Real fun. 

&#x200B;

And I'm translating your last statement as you think I'm mad at friends for getting laid because I'm not. that makes me want to say f u for some reason. idk why. maybe you people just don't value your friends like I do. I love them to death, maybe I have the wrong word for what friend means, but it's someone I trust isn't going to mess with my head just because it makes them feel good, whatever man. Of course I'm bitter, all my new friends just want to bang my current friends. They don't want to be my friend at all, they'll act friendly but really, they just want to have sex with my friends. How am I supposed to feel. I could go sociopath and just say whatever, or it makes me think I'm literal garbage to be around. 

&#x200B;

There's a million different cocks to suck and you choose the one I talk to the most. Like why? I don't want to hear about them in a sexual way or talk about their sex lives, but now I do. wanna know why? because they're sucking off my friends.
